  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    AuthKit signs users in to external services with OAuth2 (Authorization Code with PKCE, or Implicit) and keeps their tokens across sessions.
    
    This demo runs one OAuth2 session: Test token stores a local token so you can try Get token and Sign out right away. Sign in opens your provider's sign-in page and needs real client settings on a device.
